#. module: theme_bookstore
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bookstore.s_banner
msgid ""
"\"I've never found a bookstore with such variety and charm. Every visit "
"feels like uncovering a hidden treasure!\""
msgstr ""
"\"ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ເຄີຍພົບຮ້ານປຶ້ມທີ່ມີຄວາມຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ແລະ ມີສະເໜ່ແບບນີ້ມາກ່ອນເລີຍ. ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ມາຢ້ຽມຊົມ ຮູ້ສຶກຄືກັບໄດ້ຄົ້ນພົ"
"ບຊັບສົມບັດທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້!\""

#. module: theme_bookstore
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bookstore.s_key_images
msgid "101 Essays That Will Change the Way You Think"
msgstr "101 ບົດຄວາມທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນວິທີຄິດຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: theme_bookstore
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bookstore.s_banner
msgid "Adventure awaits at the Bookstore"
msgstr "ການຜະຈົນໄພລໍຖ້າທ່ານຢູ່ທີ່ຮ້ານປຶ້ມ"

#. module: theme_bookstore
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_theme_bookstore
msgid "Bookstore Theme"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຮ້ານປຶ້ມ"

#. module: theme_bookstore
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bookstore.s_key_images
msgid "Boundless"
msgstr "ໄຮ້ຂອບເຂດ"

#. module: theme_bookstore
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bookstore.s_banner
msgid "Come Visit Us <i class=\"oi\" data-icon=\"keyboard_arrow_right\"/>"
msgstr "ມາຢ້ຽມຊົມພວກເຮົາ <i class=\"oi\" data-icon=\"keyboard_arrow_right\"/>"

#. module: theme_bookstore
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bookstore.s_banner
msgid ""
"Discover an extensive collection of books, from bestsellers to hidden gems, "
"curated to ignite your imagination and inspire reading."
msgstr ""
"ຄົ້ນພົບຄັງລວບລວມປຶ້ມຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ປຶ້ມຂາຍດີທີ່ສຸດ ຈົນເຖິງຜົນງານອັນຊົງຄຸນຄ່າທີ່ເຊື່ອງຊ້ອນຢູ່, ຄັດສັນມາເພື່ອຈູດປ"
"ະກາຍຈິນຕະນາການ ແລະ ສ້າງແຮງບັນດານໃຈໃນການອ່ານຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: theme_bookstore
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bookstore.s_cta_box
msgid "Discover new reads,<br/> shop our bestsellers today!"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນພົບປຶ້ມອ່ານໃໝ່ໆ,<br/> ເລືອກຊື້ປຶ້ມຂາຍດີຂອງພວກເຮົາໄດ້ແລ້ວມື້ນີ້!"

#. module: theme_bookstore
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:theme_bookstore.field_theme_utils__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "ຊື່ສະແດງ"

